1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,105
M: Thank you all for joining today's tour.

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:08,085
As you know, there are four floors in the building, so we're going to start at the top floor and head down.

3
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:10,310
Are there any questions before we begin?

4
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:13,430
W: Yes, about how long will the tour last?

5
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:19,690
M: If you stay for the entire tour, it will take approximately one and a half hours to see the entire museum.

6
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:27,250
W: Unfortunately, I have to leave for a doctor's appointment in an hour, so how much of the museum will I see?

7
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:30,550
M: You'll be able to see everything except for the first floor.

8
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:32,925
W: Thank you so much for letting me know.
